"prose": [
{
"from": 119,
"to": 127,
"text": "These are the local gates /implement runs. No external process is driven and there is no live leg, so no `probe` precondition exists. There is no boot smoke: the chunk changes no Rust source and no harness path. The workspace unit suite is `defer`red on zero `.rs` delta. The mutation entry still runs, because the harness's own `no-rust-delta` verdict is the assertion. The per-OS `cargo check` runs here on the Windows host; its macOS/Linux legs are witnessed by CI. The last four entries are operator-driven: the commit+push, the CI read pinned to the pushed sha, the `nightly.yml` dispatch, and that dispatched run's read pinned to the same sha. The deny/zizmor JSON artifacts (`target/supply-chain/`, gitignored) have no local producer by design. They are produced by the CI `supply-chain` job on the operator's push, and that job's `success` is read by the check-runs entry. Every local output path (`target/deny-probes/`, `mutants.out/`) is gitignored (`git check-ignore -q` exit 0 on each)."
}
],
